{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_015C40","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"如果友情度表示同伴之间的信任关系，那么表示你个人声望的就是『英雄度』。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"AUX_TERM_NORMALIZED_TO_JPN"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"『英雄度』？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":"AUX_TERM_NORMALIZED_TO_JPN"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"没错。你的声望也会影响MSF招募人员。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"英雄度够高的话，就算是用富尔顿回收带回来的敌兵，也用不了多久就能说服。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"AUX_CAUSAL_ORDER_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"这个『英雄度』要怎么提升？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"AUX_TERM_NORMALIZED_TO_JPN"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"方法很多。完成困难的任务，避免无谓杀生……反过来，要是被敌人发现后还慌慌张张，英雄度可不会上涨。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":144,"review_flag":"AUX_METAPHOR_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"另外，在CO-OPS战斗中积极攻击敌人，也会让同伴更加信赖你。不过相应地，敌人也会开始盯上你。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"没什么，不用想得太复杂。Boss平时做的就是这些。就连我看，你也已经足够称得上英雄了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":121,"review_flag":"AUX_PARAPHRASE_JPN_NUANCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"别说了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":"AUX_TONE_SOFTENED_TO_JPN"}]}